sequenceDiagram
    participant S as selectNotificationRoute
    participant P as pushAvailable
    participant M as smsAvailable
    participant E as emailAvailable
    participant C as hasSmsConsent
    participant I as immediateRoute
    participant D as durableQueueRoute

    S->>P: Check push availability
    S->>M: Check SMS availability
    M->>C: Check SMS consent
    E->>C: Check SMS consent

    loop Every available provider
        S->>I: Select immediate route
        alt Provider failure
            I->>D: Select durable queue route
        end
    end
